% The spending paths of the policy.
rule managers with provenance the Bitcoin Core wallet Miniscript tests,
        confer "A Revault Unvault policy with the older() replaced by an after()":
the coin can be spent if
    the witness contains a signature by manager 1
    and the witness contains a signature by manager 2
    and the witness contains a signature by cosigning server 1
    and the witness contains a signature by cosigning server 2
    and the witness contains a signature by cosigning server 3
    and the witness contains a signature by cosigning server 4
    and the spending transaction has the lock time a number N
    and the lock time N is a block height
    and N >= 424242
    and the spending transaction is in block a height H
    and N < H.

rule stakeholders with provenance the Bitcoin Core wallet Miniscript tests,
        confer "A Revault Unvault policy with the older() replaced by an after()":
the coin can be spent if
    the witness contains a signature by stakeholder 1
    and the witness contains a signature by stakeholder 2
    and the witness contains a signature by stakeholder 3
    and the witness contains a signature by stakeholder 4.

